msgid "# MiniMax-M3"
msgstr "# MiniMax-M3"

msgid "## 1 Introduction"
msgstr "## 1 简介"

msgid ""
"MiniMax-M3 is a multimodal large language model that supports text, image, "
"and video inputs. On Ascend, it supports BF16 and W8A8 deployment, thinking "
"mode, reasoning parsing, tool-call parsing, and multimodal inputs."
msgstr ""
"MiniMax-M3 是一个支持文本、图像和视频输入的多模态大语言模型。在升腾上，它支持 BF16 和 W8A8 "
"部署、思考模式、推理解析、工具调用解析以及多模态输入。"

msgid ""
"This document covers supported features, environment and model preparation, "
"single-node deployment, multi-node deployment, thinking and parser "
"configuration, functional verification, accuracy evaluation, and "
"troubleshooting."
msgstr "本文档涵盖支持的特性、环境和模型准备、单节点部署、多节点部署、思考与解析器配置、功能验证、精度评估以及故障排查。"

msgid ""
"This document is written based on the latest vLLM-Ascend version. This model"
" is supported on the main branch."
msgstr "本文档基于最新的 vLLM-Ascend 版本编写。该模型在 main 分支上受支持。"

msgid "## 2 Supported Features"
msgstr "## 2 支持的特性"

msgid "## 3 Prerequisites"
msgstr "## 3 前提条件"

msgid "### 3.1 Model Weight"
msgstr "### 3.1 模型权重"

msgid ""
"The `MiniMax-M3` BF16 model requires 16 × 64 GB NPU chips. [Download the model weights](https://www.modelscope.cn/collections/MiniMax/MiniMax-M3).\n"
"We also provide `W8A8` quant model requires at least 8 x 64G NPU chips. [Download the model weights](https://www.modelscope.cn/models/Eco-Tech/MiniMax-M3-w8a8-0626)\n"
"It is recommended to place the model weight in a shared cache directory."
msgstr ""
"`MiniMax-M3` BF16 模型需要 16 × 64 GB NPU 芯片。[下载模型权重](https://www.modelscope.cn/collections/MiniMax/MiniMax-M3)。\n"
"我们还提供 `W8A8` 量化模型，至少需要 8 x 64G NPU 芯片。[下载模型权重](https://www.modelscope.cn/models/Eco-Tech/MiniMax-M3-w8a8-0626)。\n"
"建议将模型权重放置在共享缓存目录中。"

